    <title>Useful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-27T00:35:14Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-1" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">A strip of masking tape makes a handy label for freezer containers: write the contents and date on it, then peel it off cleanly when you wash the tub.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#1f42d489fd28bf97dc3724e2e729ba2c158b0cc1a183560861e70b6b1ac5cc61</id>
    <title>Hopeful</title>
    <updated>2026-11-27T00:35:14Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-2" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Ugly fruit can still make excellent jam: cooking softens blemishes and brings out flavour, while preserving a surplus gives misshapen produce a useful second life.</div>
    </content>
  </entry>
  <entry>
    <id>https://positivitybriefing.com/feed.atom#88c7c2cbd23a53afaf6bf2ae2681cb483bc2c4e0302ab383a3a1cde793622806</id>
    <title>Action</title>
    <updated>2026-11-27T00:35:14Z</updated>
    <link rel="alternate" href="https://positivitybriefing.com/#item-3" type="text/html"/>
    <content type="xhtml">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">Choose a familiar tune and conduct it with one hand as though leading a tiny orchestra; make the final note absurdly grand, then bow to an imaginary audience.</div>
    </content>
